The fill color to use for this app bar.

    If `None`, :attr:`flet.BottomAppBarTheme.bgcolor` is used;
    if that is also `None`, then defaults to :attr:`flet.ColorScheme.surface`.

The color of the shadow below this app bar.

    If `None`, :attr:`flet.BottomAppBarTheme.shadow_color` is used;
    if that is also `None`, then defaults to :attr:`flet.Colors.TRANSPARENT`.

The notch that is made for the floating action button.

    If `None`, :attr:`flet.BottomAppBarTheme.shape` is used;
    if that is also `None`, then the shape will be rectangular with no notch.

Defines how the :attr:`content` of this container is clipped.

    Defaults to `ClipBehavior.ANTI_ALIAS` if :attr:`border_radius` is not `None`;
    otherwise `ClipBehavior.NONE`.

Defines the padding around the :attr:`controls`.

    If `None`, :attr:`flet.ExpansionTileTheme.controls_padding` is used;
    if that is also `None`, then defaults to `Padding.all(0)`.

Defines the alignment of :attr:`controls`, which are arranged in a column when the     tile is expanded.

    If `None`, :attr:`flet.ExpansionTileTheme.expanded_alignment` is used;
    if that is also `None`, then defaults to :attr:`flet.Alignment.CENTER`.

The color to display behind the sublist when :attr:`expanded`.

    If `None`, :attr:`flet.ExpansionTileTheme.bgcolor` is used;
    if that is also `None`, then defaults to :attr:`flet.Colors.TRANSPARENT`.

Defines the background color of this tile when the sublist is collapsed     (:attr:`expanded` is False).

    If `None`, :attr:`flet.ExpansionTileTheme.collapsed_bgcolor` is used;
    if that is also `None`, then defaults to :attr:`flet.Colors.TRANSPARENT`.
